				<img height="283" src="img/kaniebi3_013_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/epoch/kaniebi3/img/kaniebi3_013.jpg" --></a><a href="img/kaniebi3_014.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/kaniebi3_014_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/epoch/kaniebi3/img/kaniebi3_014.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
